claim.claim-text:
means for transmitting (301), to a base station (120), first information indicating that Physical Uplink Shared Channel, PUSCH, transmission using a first resource block set and a second resource block set is supported by the UE (130), wherein the first resource block set and the second resource block set are located on a frequency axis non-consecutively;
means for receiving (301), from the base station (120), second information indicating to the UE (130) the first resource block set and the second resource block set which are allocated to the UE (130) for the PUSCH transmission, wherein the second information depends on the first information; and
